      "html": "<p>Quickler runs the check and records what it finds. This refresher is in date. This one lapses next month. This supervision is overdue. Each gap becomes a job with an owner and a date. A group sees every home in one list.</p><p>It is not a learning system and not an HR system. It does not deliver training or hold personnel files. Those stay in your own systems.</p>"
    },
