      "kind": "faq",
      "heading": "Questions, answered",
      "html": "<h3>What is a training and supervision matrix?</h3><p>A map of who is current on which mandatory training, and whose supervision and appraisal are on time. It shows lapses in time to close them, across the whole team including bank and agency.</p><h3>What training is mandatory for care home staff?</h3><p>No single national law lists it for every role. Common ones are moving and handling, safeguarding, fire safety, infection control and basic life support. Build the matrix from your policies and current guidance.</p><h3>Does Quickler replace our HR or training system?</h3><p>No. It checks that the matrix is current and gaps are closing. Training and staff files stay in your own systems.</p><h3>Can I run the matrix check over WhatsApp?</h3><p>Yes. Answer by text or voice note. The report and list of jobs write themselves. No new app and no login.</p><h3>Related guides</h3><ul><li><a href=\"/pages/cqc-compliance-audit-checklist-uk.html\">CQC compliance audit checklist</a></li><li><a href=\"/pages/care-home-compliance-checklist-monthly-uk.html\">Monthly care home compliance checklist</a></li><li><a href=\"/pages/safeguarding-audit-care-home-uk.html\">Safeguarding audit for care homes</a></li></ul>"
